# Clutter setters that stay in the property batch (Gsr.Client.Clutter.Batch.call_value).
# A setter not listed here is call_value and flushes the batch.
# Clutter.BoxLayout is not an actor, so it is not listed.
# St setters live in libst-rpc-16/batch.whitelist.

Clutter.Actor.set_x_expand
Clutter.Actor.set_y_expand
Clutter.Actor.set_x_align
Clutter.Actor.set_y_align
Clutter.Actor.set_reactive
Clutter.Actor.set_opacity
